    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Single jet rotary vane wheel water meters with dry mechanical indicating device, designed to measure, memorize and display the volume at metering conditions of water passing through the measurement transducer. They consist of a brass body with connecting screw threads, a strainer in front of wet measuring unit, a shaft, a rotary vane wheel, gear box, a magnetic coupling (wet and dry side), a rubber O-ring, a plastic plate closing the water meter, magnetic shields and a mechanical indicating device formed by numbered rollers with five drums, three pointers and pilot. Adjustment is realized by adjusting the position of screw; access to the adjusting screw is protected by seal. To be installed in horizontal position with the indicating device at the top; not designed to measure reverse flow. Sealed by connecting the plastic ring to the brass body by a wire with seal."
